Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.06,0:00:02.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We beg you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.02,0:00:05.56,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Please keep her in this house!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.61,0:00:08.36,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Put her in your house.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.36,0:00:09.48,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.48,0:00:12.49,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I can only think of the Ayase residence\Nthat can take in someone like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.74,0:00:14.86,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We already got a cat, so why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.86,0:00:17.32,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't lump me together\Nwith a nobody like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.32,0:00:19.33,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That thing doesn't even eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.83,0:00:23.08,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So what happened\Nto the male one anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.16,0:00:24.87,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It went back to the chemistry room.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.12,0:00:26.04,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.71,0:00:30.88,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,"I can stay an anatomical model without\Nworries as long as Hana is okay," he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.30,0:00:34.55,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But in return, he's gonna\Nsneak outta school at night
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.55,0:00:36.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,and he'd like to see Hana then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.93,0:00:39.60,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We have to rely on\Nyour magnanimous heart, Auntie!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.60,0:00:40.89,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.97,0:00:42.35,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.68,0:00:47.10,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Sheesh. Anatomical models\Ngetting in heat, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.40,0:00:50.36,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Just be lovey-dovey without\Nbothering the neighbors.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.77,0:00:52.90,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Anyway, what about the ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.03,0:00:54.70,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, about that...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.99,0:00:57.70,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It was just a Christmas ornament.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.70,0:00:59.12,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.33,0:01:03.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Kinda like when animals make\Ntheir butts glow when they're courting?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.00,0:01:04.50,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Then it can't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.79,0:01:06.92,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No, I'm not convinced at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.92,0:01:09.21,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We're gonna eat, so pull the table out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.38,0:01:11.09,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun, you'll eat too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.09,0:01:13.09,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, sure. I'd love to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.93,0:01:17.09,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Man, what a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.09,0:01:20.26,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Momo, you have\Nsome amazing powers, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.39,0:01:23.64,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I understand why Auntie\Ntrusted you to do the exorcism!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.64,0:01:26.39,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And Okarun, too!\NThat transformation was wicked!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.64,0:01:28.48,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It was so badass!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.48,0:01:31.11,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I wish I had some kind of power, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.23,0:01:33.23,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, well, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.23,0:01:35.61,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm getting the table out\Nso can you guys move?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.61,0:01:37.74,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, let me help!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.32,0:01:40.45,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Thanks. Hold that end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.70,0:01:42.49,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Roger that!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.91,0:01:47.12,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Come on!\NYou're just getting in my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.37,0:01:49.38,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, Momo, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.75,0:01:54.05,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Got some lint.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.01,0:01:58.01,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.13,0:02:00.34,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Gimme more thanks, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.34,0:02:02.10,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Just move, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.10,0:02:03.76,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll get outta the way after one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.76,0:02:05.10,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Then I'll never say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.98,0:02:11.90,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're the one I fell in love with.\NI won't let go of you no matter what!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.31,0:02:16.32,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I don't do anything right here and now,\NI'll regret it for the rest of my life!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.32,0:02:18.74,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.57,0:02:21.87,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There's lint!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.49,0:02:26.62,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Got it. Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.04,0:02:28.08,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.41,0:02:29.25,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.83,0:02:32.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I decided that\NI'm not going to hold back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.71,0:02:35.30,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I decided that\NI'm going to fight adamantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.50,0:02:36.46,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Against what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.09,0:02:42.26,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm looking at only you{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.26,0:02:47.35,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Since the day I met you,\Nall the way to right now{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.47,0:02:51.40,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to shout that I love you{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.40,0:02:53.86,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let's try to change tomorrow{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.86,0:02:55.73,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, morons. You're in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.90,0:02:57.23,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Settle down!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.23,0:02:58.61,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You'll kick up dust all over the place!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.61,0:02:59.95,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Sorry, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.95,0:03:03.07,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And Momo, you're gonna stay over\Nat Jiji's place this weekend
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.07,0:03:04.70,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,so you better have your\Nunderwear and stuff ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.70,0:03:07.33,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey! Why would you\Nsay stuff like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.54,0:03:10.41,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase? At Mr. Jiji's house? Why!?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.62,0:03:13.50,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What? I didn't tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.75,0:03:17.25,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Jiji's house is cursed\Nand he wants it exorcised.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.76,0:03:19.51,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's why he came to our place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.22,0:03:26.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase, were you going\Nto go there all alone with Mr. Jiji!?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.68,0:03:28.02,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.02,0:03:30.23,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I was planning on asking you\Nto come along, Okarun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.60,0:03:32.52,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'd feel a bit uneasy doing it by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.81,0:03:34.94,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Then let's hurry up and get it done!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.94,0:03:38.61,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Let's resolve it quickly and have\NMr. Jiji hurry on home!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.61,0:03:40.61,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Thank you! Woo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.61,0:03:41.99,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What? What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.74,0:03:49.95,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Crap! School at night is super scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.12,0:03:51.91,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Isn't it bad to go in without permission?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.91,0:03:55.17,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's fine. We're just gonna\Nplay with a Ouija board.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.17,0:03:56.67,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll film it on video.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.88,0:03:59.88,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? Hold on,\Ndo you hear something?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.88,0:04:01.97,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Come on, stop that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.80,0:04:08.22,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- No way. For real?\N- What? No, scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.23,0:04:14.69,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're in the way! Stand aside!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.91,0:04:27.91,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,KAMIGOE CITY STATION
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.12,0:04:29.62,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Wait for me, Hana!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.62,0:04:31.95,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm coming to see you right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.95,0:04:33.87,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hana!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.14,0:04:51.02,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,He's not here yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.48,0:04:56.02,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And it's four o'clock already.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.03,0:05:08.66,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's fine. I'll wait here\Nwith you until he shows up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.62,0:05:11.74,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sure he'll come.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.62,0:05:15.16,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.61,0:05:44.11,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Sorry for being late, Hana.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.94,0:05:46.15,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Taro.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.11,0:05:48.45,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.06,0:06:17.10,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Crap. I fell asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.48,0:06:18.60,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.73,0:06:20.90,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If you're here, you should wake me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.15,0:06:23.73,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, Miss Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.02,0:06:26.90,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You were waiting with her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.99,0:06:30.74,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I had a lot happen tonight, but starting\Ntomorrow, I will make sure to come on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.74,0:06:32.41,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're gonna come every day?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.83,0:06:36.20,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,KEEP OUT\NJIJI'S ROOM
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.46,0:06:48.17,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Damn it, I can't sleep again tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.18,0:06:55.97,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Because of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.36,0:08:30.78,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll pretend to take this,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.36,0:08:32.70,BD Center Right,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(608.333333,186.666667)}EPISODE 12\NLET'S GO\NTO THE CURSED HOUSE
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.78,0:08:32.24,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,and then take this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.03,0:08:35.66,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun, you really suck\Nat playing Old Maid!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.66,0:08:38.45,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You guys just have demented personalities!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.58,0:08:40.49,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Maybe you're naïve? Yeah, naïve!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.49,0:08:42.37,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,A naïve Okarun? Priceless!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.37,0:08:43.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I won't play anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.04,0:08:47.04,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Sheesh, that was just a joke.\NWe're kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.04,0:08:50.25,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun! I'll give you some candy!\NSo cheer up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.13,0:08:54.43,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Wow, these are so nostalgic.\NI love these!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.43,0:08:57.30,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I bought a ton so you should\Neat some too, Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.18,0:09:01.39,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,By the way, I was really impressed that\Nthe candy shop over there still exists!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.39,0:09:04.06,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That grandma running the shop\Nnever changes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.19,0:09:08.06,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,She still did the, "Here you go.\NYour change is 500,000 yen," bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.06,0:09:11.53,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I was so touched\Nlike Creamy Mami, woo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.69,0:09:14.24,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I hate having thoughts like this.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.91,0:09:18.74,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I get fed up\Nwith my own shortcomings.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.58,0:09:22.79,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}But I can't do anything about this feeling.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.25,0:09:25.37,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to take my mind off of it somehow.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.83,0:09:28.58,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to concentrate\Non getting my nut back!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.42,0:09:33.92,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nut... Nut... Nut...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.34,0:09:35.34,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nut...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.42,0:09:37.51,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nut, nut, nut, nut, nut...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.51,0:09:40.10,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nut, nut, nut, nut, nut, nut...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.10,0:09:40.93,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.93,0:09:41.76,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,My nut!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.43,0:09:45.98,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun, you're thinking about\Nyour nut too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.98,0:09:47.73,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No, that's not it! This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.73,0:09:50.36,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, I've been wondering\Nfor a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.36,0:09:52.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Since when have dirty jokes\Nbeen the new thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.57,0:09:55.95,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh no, that's not it.\NThere's a lot of things going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.11,0:09:58.49,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Then I'll make\Nsomething else get popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.49,0:09:59.87,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hip joint!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.12,0:10:02.45,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No. Dirty jokes are not in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.54,0:10:03.49,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Vamo lá!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.49,0:10:05.29,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's Kazu's thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.79,0:10:08.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Pathetic! You're so pathetic, Ken!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.62,0:10:11.71,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}But at this rate,\Nmy own heart won't last!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.55,0:10:15.67,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I must take initiative\Nin grasping Miss Ayase's interests.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.72,0:10:22.18,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I will now talk about tsuchinokos!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.81,0:10:24.18,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Whoa now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.18,0:10:25.81,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Tsuchinoko? I wanna hear!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.06,0:10:28.85,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,UMAs are not creatures of fantasy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.85,0:10:32.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Actually, even gorillas were UMAs\Nuntil about a hundred years ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.44,0:10:37.03,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And I believe that a tsuchinoko will be\Nthe next UMA to follow in the footsteps of gorillas!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.73,0:10:37.03,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,SPECIAL FEATURE\NTHE TRUTH ABOUT THE TSUCHINOKO
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.03,0:10:38.95,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,BECOME POPULAR WITH\NHIGH DIMENSIONAL POWERS
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.28,0:10:40.95,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, our village has\Na legend of a great serpent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.95,0:10:44.74,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,A shrine that's said to have 200 years\Nof history and worships a great snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.74,0:10:47.04,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's called Tsuchinoko Shrine!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.04,0:10:48.29,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.54,0:10:51.92,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Let's go to that shrine! I want to see\Na giant tsuchinoko snake!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.92,0:10:55.55,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Sheesh, you're so hopeless.\NStay close to me at all times, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.55,0:10:57.26,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Crap! The initiative!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.42,0:10:59.43,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,A mummified kappa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.43,0:11:01.76,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There's a shrine that worships that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.76,0:11:05.18,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So shrines that worship UMAs\Nare not that uncommon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.64,0:11:08.14,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}How's that? I'll toss that UMA shrine legend\Nright back at ya!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.73,0:11:11.73,BD Top Left,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,GIANT MAN-EATING WORM\NDEEP DIVE!!\NWHERE SUBTERRANEANS GATHER!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.85,0:11:11.73,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Seriously? Isn't that totally wicked?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.90,0:11:13.73,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That means kappas exist!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.90,0:11:15.77,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on, then what about Nessie?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.77,0:11:17.40,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,They have a photo and everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.40,0:11:19.24,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I personally think they exist!\NBecause I want to see them!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.24,0:11:21.66,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The photograph of Nessie\Nis called the Surgeon's Photograph.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.78,0:11:25.58,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,They have since determined it to be a fake,\Nbut I saw one recently with my own eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.58,0:11:27.83,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Seriously? I wanna see one, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.83,0:11:30.12,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Huh? Come to think,\Nthis is the first time{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.79,0:11:31.25,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So they really do exist!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.12,0:11:32.83,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}that I've talked this much to someone\Nother than Miss Ayase.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.25,0:11:33.67,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,More like, I've never been able\Nto talk about stuff like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.67,0:11:34.92,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is fun!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.67,0:11:34.92,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,This is fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.13,0:11:38.01,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun, you're amazing!\NYou know everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.01,0:11:40.38,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I totally respect you as a friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.80,0:11:43.59,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,F-Friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.59,0:11:44.89,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? We're not?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.89,0:11:47.06,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm totally shocked, and absorbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.18,0:11:49.06,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're one of Momo's friends, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.23,0:11:52.02,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Then can you make me\None of your friends, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.52,0:11:56.27,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Sorry, I am an awkward fellow\Nafter all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.27,0:11:59.03,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I told you to not say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.03,0:12:00.95,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? What's up? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.95,0:12:02.86,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You don't have to know, Jiji!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.11,0:12:05.87,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Even Momo is leaving me out\Nof the loop, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.87,0:12:10.12,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why isn't he more despicable?\NIf he's such a good guy,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.00,0:12:12.16,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}then I...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.46,0:12:20.55,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.67,0:12:22.93,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,This is a hot springs district!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.18,0:12:25.39,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's in relation to my dad's work...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.55,0:12:27.85,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Wasn't your dad a teacher or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.39,0:12:31.48,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,He's doing research on volcanoes\Nat a nearby college.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.98,0:12:34.52,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And that's why we all moved here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.65,0:12:37.23,BD Top Right,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,MANJU\NHOT SPRINGS MANJU
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.85,0:12:37.23,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,A volcano? Is it okay?\NNot gonna erupt or anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.36,0:12:38.19,BD Top Right,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,TARGET PRACTICE\NAMUSEMENT CENTER
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.82,0:12:42.07,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There are records that it erupted\Nabout 200 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.07,0:12:44.28,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But it seems to have calmed down since.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.28,0:12:45.20,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.58,0:12:53.12,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Slurp-a-durp!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.91,0:12:55.08,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Are we gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.08,0:12:56.38,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't wanna hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.63,0:12:58.42,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hurray!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.10,0:13:17.44,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Slurp-a-durp!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.65,0:13:21.44,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hurray!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.95,0:13:35.66,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,This way now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.21,0:13:42.84,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,How is it, Momo?\NDo you see a weird aura or anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.96,0:13:45.84,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Just how much stamina do you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.30,0:13:52.18,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't see anything at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.43,0:13:53.93,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Like, it's totally ordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.93,0:13:55.10,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.10,0:13:58.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,All the spirit mediums said\Nit was totally bad news!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.52,0:14:01.15,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,More like I want to get\Nsome rest first. I'm thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.15,0:14:03.28,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Wait, you really can't see anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.28,0:14:04.49,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Really? For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.49,0:14:05.95,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Really, for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.95,0:14:09.03,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,H-Hold on, Miss Ayase.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.87,0:14:12.70,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun, hurry on over!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.70,0:14:13.83,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.34,0:14:27.09,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,How is it, Miss Ayase?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.09,0:14:28.97,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Do you see any weird auras or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.89,0:14:36.89,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}How is it?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.89,0:14:38.69,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The TV turned on by itself!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.69,0:14:40.15,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.15,0:14:41.86,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, that scared me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.86,0:14:44.36,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Why did you suddenly turn on the TV?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.36,0:14:46.28,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Because I'm bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.53,0:14:48.11,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There's nothing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.61,0:14:52.70,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}And that's it for us!\NBack to the studio!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.66,0:14:56.12,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? Are you doubting me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.20,0:14:57.50,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.79,0:15:01.17,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,When spirit mediums came by,\Nthey said this place was bad news, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.17,0:15:05.13,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,This is my prediction, but maybe\Nthose ghosts are hiding right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.96,0:15:08.47,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It was like this\Nback with Turbo Granny, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.67,0:15:11.84,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,When the spirit's power is weak,\Nit's hard for me to notice them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.84,0:15:14.43,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So it's easy for them to go into hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.56,0:15:15.76,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,In other words...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.10,0:15:17.52,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,This'll be a piece of cake, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.52,0:15:18.98,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,How awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.31,0:15:21.44,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Lady Momo! Allow me\Nto massage your shoulders!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.44,0:15:22.27,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.82,0:15:26.98,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I have no objections.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.98,0:15:31.53,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, I want to drink some juice.\NA sweet one!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.53,0:15:33.62,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I will get some ready right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.62,0:15:35.62,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Touched... Shoulder...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.74,0:15:38.79,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Let's get some rest for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.58,0:15:41.12,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun, you should sit too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.96,0:15:51.55,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Spirits are gonna show up at night anyway,\Nso let's rest when we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.14,0:15:55.85,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.18,0:15:58.52,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And so, I'm gonna head out\Ninto the hot springs district!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.52,0:15:59.27,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.18,0:16:04.02,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Did you just say there were no spirits\Nbecause you wanted to go to the hot springs?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.02,0:16:07.02,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's not true! There really aren't any!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.40,0:16:09.69,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Anyway, please have fun with Jiji, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.69,0:16:11.90,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? You're really gonna go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.90,0:16:14.07,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do\Nif a spirit shows up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.32,0:16:17.87,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's fine! I'll be back by evening!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.08,0:16:19.62,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm heading out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.62,0:16:21.04,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- Hurray!\N- Wait, Miss Ayase!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.04,0:16:22.79,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hurray!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.79,0:16:25.92,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Lady Momo! I have brought you\Nyour sweet juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.92,0:16:26.84,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.00,0:16:29.67,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase went to the hot springs district.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.67,0:16:33.01,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Seriously? I wanted to go with her!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.01,0:16:38.35,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Wanna play soccer?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.18,0:16:42.81,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You trap it, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.81,0:16:43.77,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Yup, that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.77,0:16:44.69,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're good!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.90,0:16:46.73,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Now try kicking it my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.86,0:16:50.19,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Get your pivot foot next to the ball, and\Nkick it here with the inside of your foot!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.69,0:16:53.32,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.74,0:16:54.78,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.78,0:16:55.61,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.87,0:16:58.08,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Sorry about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.41,0:16:59.83,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm so pathetic.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.83,0:17:02.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm glad Miss Ayase isn't here!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.37,0:17:04.12,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}But if I practice here,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.12,0:17:06.63,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I might be able to show Miss Ayase\Nwhen the time is right!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.92,0:17:10.30,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, that's amazing, Okarun!\NYou're so cool!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.63,0:17:13.47,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, Okarun!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.55,0:17:15.38,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.47,0:17:17.05,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You in love with Momo?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.18,0:17:20.14,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.85,0:17:25.81,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I hope they're getting along.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.27,0:17:31.40,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's a first guy friend for Okarun,\Nso I'm sure I'd just get in the way.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.86,0:17:34.24,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Good for you, Okarun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.16,0:17:38.32,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I mean, Momo is cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.62,0:17:41.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- For me, Miss Ayase was my first friend.\N- Hey, pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.54,0:17:44.91,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I respect her, and she's very dear to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.12,0:17:46.37,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Nice pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.37,0:17:51.38,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I see, someone dear to you.\NSomeone you respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.34,0:17:56.43,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I really love Momo's face\Nand personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.09,0:17:59.43,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I do as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.30,0:18:01.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.76,0:18:03.27,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You just said respect!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.47,0:18:05.60,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's respect on top of all that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.60,0:18:07.02,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Isn't that a bit unfair?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.02,0:18:10.36,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Then I'll add how I love\NMomo's eyes! There, I win!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.36,0:18:10.98,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Wha...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.98,0:18:13.53,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Then I'll say all that, plus I love her mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.69,0:18:14.99,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There! I win!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.99,0:18:16.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Nope, no good! That's no good!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.82,0:18:18.28,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You can't say "no good"!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.41,0:18:21.66,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I first started off saying I like her face,\Nso yours doesn't count!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.66,0:18:24.08,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Then your love of her eyes\Nwon't count either!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.08,0:18:25.50,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.91,0:18:28.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm Momo's childhood friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.00,0:18:29.46,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There, I win!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.46,0:18:31.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Grrrr!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.30,0:18:35.13,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Win...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.13,0:18:36.42,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? In what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.42,0:18:38.80,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You can't just say\Nyou win outta nowhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.01,0:18:39.97,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.22,0:18:41.93,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Right, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.93,0:18:43.43,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.27,0:18:48.02,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm starting to feel dizzy.\NTime to head out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.90,0:18:57.24,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's too bad that it's an open-air bath,\Nbut the walls are too high to see any scenery.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.95,0:19:03.37,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, we already have someone here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.03,0:19:07.75,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And she's quite a hottie!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.92,0:19:13.04,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What!?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.54,0:19:17.42,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're so stubborn!\NBut I'll admit you've got some guts!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.63,0:19:20.55,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm not done yet! I haven't given up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.72,0:19:25.47,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, let's shake hands as friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.68,0:19:28.81,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.23,0:19:30.60,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I got you now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.60,0:19:32.52,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.86,0:19:35.73,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase would never be okay\Nwith something this sneaky!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.73,0:19:37.90,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Admit defeat, Okarun!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.03,0:19:40.95,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No way! I'm not gonna give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.95,0:19:42.24,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.91,0:19:46.83,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Mr. Jiji, stop! Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.50,0:19:51.25,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Look at what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.25,0:19:53.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.59,0:19:56.96,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Isn't it a bit strange there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.26,0:20:05.26,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There wasn't a room\Nright next to the foyer, was there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.64,0:20:10.18,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Young lady, you came\Nto a co-ed bath while being so young?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.73,0:20:13.31,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,MALE/FEMALE COMMUNAL USE\NWATCH YOUR FEET
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.48,0:20:13.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There's no way I could read that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.60,0:20:15.02,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Whew, so hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.02,0:20:17.11,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,A beer would be nice right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.11,0:20:18.78,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Paradise!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.61,0:20:22.40,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I didn't notice at all, but you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.40,0:20:24.74,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It was jutting out\Nwhen we look at it from the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.95,0:20:27.28,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There should be something here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.25,0:20:31.62,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's hollow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.29,0:20:34.21,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yikes. What should I do?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.21,0:20:36.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to get out right now,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.00,0:20:38.50,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}but those guys are in the way\Nso it's hard to get out.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.50,0:20:40.51,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh no! I have to hurry out of here.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.51,0:20:42.55,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm starting to feel lightheaded!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.26,0:20:44.76,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Let's try breaking it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.76,0:20:45.76,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Is it all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.76,0:20:49.27,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Probably not. We're renting the house,\Nbut we gotta do it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.81,0:20:52.10,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There has to be some reason...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.27,0:20:54.52,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,A reason why my parents\Nended up that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.31,0:20:58.27,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Young lady, do you know about gators?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.27,0:20:58.94,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.23,0:21:01.90,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Gators? You mean those things\Nthat look like lizards?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.40,0:21:04.91,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Nope, that's not it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.91,0:21:11.66,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,They're guys who often show up\Nin co-ed baths and target naked women.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.63,0:21:20.38,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Can I deal with all of them\Nusing my psychic powers?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.93,0:21:34.39,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've heard that a pack of wolves disperse\Nas soon as you strike their leader.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.36,0:21:43.61,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Crap!{\i0}
